## Vendored source

**Monocypher** — `beta1/vendor/monocypher/`
Dual-licensed **BSD-2-Clause OR CC0-1.0**. Full text in
`beta1/vendor/monocypher/LICENCE.md`; every file carries an SPDX identifier.
Copyright Loup Vaillant, Michael Savage and Fabio Scotoni.
Used for X25519, Ed25519, ChaCha20, Poly1305 and SHA-512.

*Version:* the headers read `Monocypher version __git__`, so this was taken
